          "content": "Write down constituent identities, reinforcement form, interphase treatment, stacking sequence, process history and part geometry; define whether fractions are measured by area, mass or volume; and record the process history that could alter **ply order, actual thickness and reference midplane**. For any local observation, describe why its sampling plan represents the part. Treat **cure-induced curvature or unexpected D16/D26 coupling** as an explicit rival explanation and plan **full-field curvature and ply stack inspection** as an independent check.",
