          "content": "Write down constituent identities, reinforcement form, interphase treatment, stacking sequence, process history and part geometry; define whether fractions are measured by area, mass or volume; and record the process history that could alter **notch, cyclic history and environmental conditioning**. For any local observation, describe why its sampling plan represents the part. Treat **invisible interlaminar defects after impact** as an explicit rival explanation and plan **fractography and conditioned residual-strength coupons** as an independent check.",
