          "content": "Write down constituent identities, reinforcement form, interphase treatment, stacking sequence, process history and part geometry; define whether fractions are measured by area, mass or volume; and record the process history that could alter **hybrid geometry, matrix chemistry and loading**. For any local observation, describe why its sampling plan represents the part. Treat **added porosity or interface embrittlement** as an explicit rival explanation and plan **three-direction electrical/thermal measurements and fracture tests** as an independent check.",
          "simulations": []
